              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vakasara vavo vakaurayiwa nomunondo wakabuda mumuromo wouyo akanga akatasva bhiza, uye shiri dzose dzakagutswa nenyama yavo.",
          "type": "text",
